{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17425","headline":"赠梁国惠康公主挽歌词二首 一 · 权德舆","name":"赠梁国惠康公主挽歌词二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"外馆嫔仪贵，中参睿渥深。\n初笄横白玉，盛服镂黄金。\n风度箫声远，河低婺彩沈。\n夜台留册諡，凄怆即徽音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17425.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17425","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}